<title>USA: TABLE - Becton Dickinson sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Becton Dickinson sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Becton Dickinson was priced Wednesday according to sole manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Becton Dickinson makes medical, diagnostic products, and hospital supplies.</p>
<p>BORROWER BECTON DICKINSON</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.415  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.047 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD +60 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
